  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - WeCare Mobile Healthcare Delivery Feasibility Study, through Axipitur LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for NITAJ for Commercial Investments, a Jordanian privately-owned strategic business consultancy, to create Jordan&apos;s first private mobile health services. This feasibility study will help NITAJ prepare for the deployment of ten mobile dialysis vehicles and ten mobile clinic vehicles that would serve homebound and underserved patient populations in Jordan&apos;s three most heavily populated governates.</narrative>
  </description>
